alse},{"chapter":"b2-52-komplexe-nominalgruppen","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Wirklich? Die von ihm entwickelte Theorie hat mein ganzes Studium geprägt.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_052_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-52-komplexe-nominalgruppen","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Genau deshalb will ich unbedingt zu seinem Vortrag — der Blick auf die Welt, den er verändert hat, fasziniert mich.","speaker":"Runa","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_052_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-52-komplexe-nominalgruppen","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Dann lass uns früh dort sein, bei so einem Andrang.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_052_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Die im Frühjahr veröffentlichte Studie zur Arbeitszeit zeigt einen deutlichen Anstieg.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-52-komplexe-nominalgruppen","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-52-komplexe-nominalgruppen","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Du stellst im Meeting ein Diagramm vor. Was zeigt es?","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Der Kern ist die Erhöhung, alles andere beschreibt sie nur.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-52-komplexe-nominalgruppen","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-52-komplexe-nominalgruppen","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":2,"text":"Ein Praktikant versteht die Schlagzeile nicht. Sag ihm den Kern.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":3,"text":"Die vom Land geförderte Untersuchung der Luftqualität in drei Städten beginnt im Herbst.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-52-komplexe-nominalgruppen","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-52-komplexe-nominalgruppen","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":3,"text":"Rollenspiel: Stellt euer Projekt förmlich vor.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":4,"text":"Nimm den starken Anstieg der Preise im letzten Quartal.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-52-komplexe-nominalgruppen","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-52-komplexe-nominalgruppen","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":4,"text":"Deine Kollegin braucht eine kurze Überschrift für den Bericht.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":5,"text":"Ich suche zuerst das Kernnomen; die Erhöhung ist der Kern, alles andere beschreibt sie.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-52-komplexe-nominalgruppen","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-52-komplexe-nominalgruppen","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":5,"text":"Ein Praktikant verliert im Bericht den Faden und fragt, wie du solche Sätze liest.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false}],"controls":{"story-play-line":5,"story-play-all":1,"vword-voice-F":60,"vword-voice-M":60,"vword-listen":60,"listen-to-passage":1,"audio-play-btn":1,"hear-model":5},"surfaces":[{"n":1,"w":"— (Pl.)","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":14,"w":"die","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":1,"w":"Seelen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":4,"w":"— (Sg.)","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":8,"w":"der","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":1,"w":"Spezies","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Sprichwörter","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"